  fullText: They have taken over the laboratory. Premou said that the military will\ncontinue
    all further investigations.\nI decided to leave while I still can, but I can
    not float idle while\nsomething so large is happening.\nI can not even begin
    to explain what I saw through the telescope. Find\nme at my house as soon as
    you are free.
